  "about": "Shared vectors for the screen shape's readout and aspect. Tested by internal/brand (ParseMode, ModeLabel, ShapeAspect) and by the control center's fmt.js modeLabel. A mode is the API's \"WxH@R\": 2 to 5 digits per side, a rate of 1 to 3 digits with an optional fraction, surrounding space ignored. Anything else is not a mode: the label is the input unchanged, with no HDR suffix, and the shape uses the unknown aspect.",
